== Description ==

'''Redwood''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 20 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]] and the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[Red Oak]], [[M1A]], [[R870 01]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

